OL,3,APutin's Crimea bridge partly collapses
OL,4,Aas Zelensky hails 'unprecedented'
OL,5,Aattack by Ukraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe bridge was built by Russia after it
OL,8,Finvaded and illegally annexed Ukraine's
OL,9,Fsouthern peninsula in 2014, and was
OL,10,Fpersonally opened by Putin in 2018.
